{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1000_p", "source_sha256": "20681546b57e3b789393d35b13e9eb6bdabf66b03cce023fe3f49a17a9824d5a", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、\n麗花がウェイトレスに挑戦することになった）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄中，\n丽花要挑战女服务员一职）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "d8b35bc36335f75ab5362d739478e0a56d729c0c3272f867c988ce19436b8ee6", "ja": "いらっしゃいませー♪　何名様でお越し……あっ。\n{$P$}さんは何名様ですか？", "zh": "欢迎光临～♪　请问几位客……啊。\n{$P$}先生是几位呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0ea37fc006e630b46568f1519dddb735edafbd1daf37cf2911cfc81342b4386c", "ja": "……俺は一人しかいないぞ、麗花。\nしかしウェイトレスの仕事が板についてるな！", "zh": "……我就一个人啊，丽花。\n不过服务员的工作已经干得有模有样了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "34c316ea1d82f009ffdbfacb7ddc5c7cca3c38ec394b7d7db6aa8507923d0633", "ja": "かわいいウェイトレスさんに見えるように、\n予習をたくさんしましたから♪　えっへん！", "zh": "为了看起来像可爱的女服务生，我可是做了很多预习呢♪ 得意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "28d2372fd99743905c93dde67bb0da23bddee2f75662e5b95c080a1179d2c9de", "ja": "{$P$}さんのお席は、\nこちらになります。お料理はすぐにお持ちしますね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生的座位\n在这里。菜品马上就为您端上来哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1005_p", "source_sha256": "aeac100d404feb0f163e9542e978dfd77b16ae97f5799b2e696b7dfd9d1cbb93", "ja": "ああ、わかった……って、料理？\nまだ何も注文していないけど……。", "zh": "啊，知道了……等等，料理？\n我还什么都没点呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "14d93cc48989d911d3065acde6c0d087164ed8c32478f2207766f9edabf60b16", "ja": "はい！　でもでも……今、食べたいと思うメニューが\nわかっちゃったので、私が先に頼んでおきました♪", "zh": "是的！不过不过……因为我已经知道你现在想吃什么了，所以就先帮你点好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c7c0d5d6adc0b674e107b1fc1dfac390cea40dcc5bd5d3a35bb61277f6abf0ae", "ja": "俺より仕事が早い……。\nそれで、どんな料理を頼んでくれたんだ？", "zh": "你的工作效率比我还高……  \n那你帮我点了什么菜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "bb73539562a8fc3c3fdeef9ece79a24b02d56d2b5f4b98557d3123055f939de3", "ja": "ランチメニューの『ハンバーグプレート』です！\nどうですか？　私、正解ですか？", "zh": "是午餐菜单上的“汉堡肉拼盘”！\n怎么样？我答对了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9f2f27bc688770eeafc36ab56e732021428fcc451627b515a71937baaa64fa1d", "ja": "ハンバーグプレート？　……ああ、これか。\n確かにランチで選ぶなら麗花のメニューを頼んだな。", "zh": "汉堡肉拼盘？……啊，是这个啊。\n要是午餐要选的话，我确实会点丽花推荐的套餐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7261dbe174bf9b3bb2525f698d5aaa67de4873566dc84fb499853912c6f2af99", "ja": "あっ。食後にコーヒーが飲みたいから、\nドリンクセットがいいな。これも注文してくれたのか？", "zh": "啊。我想饭后喝杯咖啡，所以选饮料套餐比较好。这个也是你点的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "9bf4938163100d379a872cfef62b7bd88bd7845e93d054f1e149eece15331163", "ja": "むむむ……コーヒーまでは予想できませんでした。\n私も修業がまだまだ足りませんね……。", "zh": "唔唔唔……连咖啡都想要这步没能预料到呢。\n我的修行也还远远不够呀……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1012_p", "source_sha256": "702af8bb2e99e5f9e0fe01d34a40854c60ce63810b322092f98c6ae2354e5e52", "ja": "いや、そんなことないよ。食べたいメニューは\nしっかり当ててたし、今のままで十分だと思うけど。", "zh": "没那回事。你想吃的菜单\n不仅猜得很准，我觉得现在这样就已经足够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "6e54199f66121fd173d5689837405d2c9a3692ca86a6cce05a56d2b194d8d012", "ja": "いいえ、ダメダメです。だから私、修業します……！\n{$P$}さん、観察させてくださいっ！", "zh": "不，完全不行。所以我决定去修行……！\n{$P$}先生，请让我观察您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1014_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "889945166ee31268a3bce3119bd6fe5a719dacd97c65cd086cb3187fa088e9d6", "ja": "隅から隅まで{$P$}さんのことを\n知れば、きっと完璧にわかるようになると思うんです♪", "zh": "如果把{$P$}先生从头到尾都了解透彻，我想一定就能完美理解了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1016_p", "source_sha256": "961d272c2a9ca80096221edc0e7fba7b066b87ac831936b04b1f956fcc9c72bc", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nなんだか本題からズレてきたような……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n总觉得好像渐渐偏离正题了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "3c215b5003a0a805f272e334b6824a4cba408168a99dd37a93c4b6f15a79a8b7", "ja": "すぐに料理を持ってくるので、待っててください。\nまずは、食事してる姿をじっくり観察しちゃいます♪", "zh": "我马上把料理端过来，请稍等。\n首先，就让我好好观察你吃饭的样子吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0383_1018_p", "source_sha256": "414cc26595b3c540841bc3bd7cd125a0ca894bfbf8bbf0e07fb288d52b42feee", "ja": "（撮影は大成功！　……だったが、\nその後もしばらくの間、麗花に観察されていた……）", "zh": "（拍摄大获成功！……虽说如此，之后的一段时间里，丽花还是一直观察着我……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
